          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_view_somewhere_published_iclr_2023",
          "text": "This paper, A View From Somewhere, published at ICLR 2023 by researchers at Sony AI and the University of Tokyo, rethinks how we represent human faces in datasets.",
