          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_instead_relying_problematic_demograp",
          "text": "Instead of relying on problematic demographic labels like race or gender, the authors collect over six hundred thousand human judgments of face similarity and learn a continuous embedding space aligned with human perception.",
