          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_result_face_representation_interpret",
          "text": "The result is a face representation that is interpretable, that avoids invasive categorical labels, and that captures the smooth, continuous nature of human phenotypic diversity, opening a new path for measuring dataset diversity more responsibly.",
