          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_top_they_build_conditional_learning",
          "text": "On top of this data they build a conditional learning framework that produces a continuous, low-dimensional, and human-interpretable embedding space, along with per-annotator masks that reveal how different people weigh different visual dimensions.",
